[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: Closure days come from OP-07 7.2 plus 24/12/2026 from memo item 6. Working days are Monday to Friday.
[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: OP-07 7.3: 'next Friday' and a weekday named on its own both mean the first such day after today, so date_rules.next_weekday = upcoming.
[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: Callback days are 'today or one of the next two working days', mapped to ['today', 'within_business_days:2'], with business_days_only = true. A second out-of-window answer, or no time at all, closes NO_CONTACT / NO_CALLBACK.
