[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: Identity questions follow OP-07 3.1 in order: postcode, then year of birth. The postcode uses kind 'upper' with one space before the last 3 characters, as the API requires (e.g. 'KM4 7RT'). No fixed length is set because UK postcodes vary in length. The birth year uses kind 'year' (four digits per 3.2 and the API). It has no 'length' key because the spec format allows length only for digits/upper.
[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: No question asks for a date, so date_order = dmy (UK bank) is only a default.
