[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: The Early deadline is 14 calendar days after today, moved back to the last working day before it if needed. Mid and Late deadlines count working days and are always working days. deadline_adjust = previous_business_day.
[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: OP-07 8.8: when the full amount is too much, the floor is offered for the same date as the amount turned down (today after the first ask) and uses no attempt, so too_much_floor = asked_date. Attempt 1 is the same amount (full, or the floor if the customer already said too much) on the 2nd working day after today. Attempt 2 (Mid and Late only) is the floor on the deadline.
[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: OP-07 9.3: with several accounts, each account's first offer is the attempt-1 offer, and today is not asked again for each account.
[  130.4s] NOTE assumption: Notes are enabled (9.5). No notes are written on any transfer (9.7). With get_account called, 12.2 decides the close code.
